BossLog: {
	Megashark.SpawnInfo: Once the three machines have fallen, twenty rounds from a Minishark into the sea. It comes up under you.
	Abomanation.SpawnInfo: Let small things go on the Wasted Mile. Bunnies, squirrels, red squirrels. None of them get away, and the tenth brings it.
}

Hints: {
	ClothierMile: Across the land, on the side that does not face the sea, there is a mile where nothing calls. I would not let a bunny go there. One goes quiet. Ten go quiet. Then something answers. Hee hee. Not that I have been, you understand.
	Offering: These may satiate one and many.
}

